# Keep source archives small.
#
# GitHub's /archive/ zip and tarball endpoints honour export-ignore, so the
# committed 16 MB debug APK is excluded from them. That matters because the
# maintainer works from a phone and moves the project between AI platforms by
# uploading a source zip; several impose an upload size limit, and without this
# the archive is ~11x larger than the code it contains.
#
# The APK is still committed and still downloadable directly from the repo — see
# dist/README.md. It is simply not bundled into source archives.
dist/ export-ignore

# Development scaffolding that is not source.
.github/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore

# Normalise line endings so archives are consistent across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be line-ending converted.
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
